{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0124_1006_p", "source_sha256": "d4d54f90eb1615a911abc76e8fefb035a2000dfefc8e926cd1f45c76cec29d59", "ja": "コンセプト？", "zh": "设计概念？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0124_1007_017kth", "source_sha256": "38bd0e23aa73e9a1fb754197297cc10fd44bea6fbc228be071392c6175bd2b64", "ja": "はい。今回のこの衣装、私だけでなく、\nエレナと恵美もすごく気に入っていて……。", "zh": "嗯，这次的服装，除了我之外，\n艾琳娜和惠美也非常中意……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0124_1008_017kth", "source_sha256": "48521005172e8f9f68c36563aec4e5246651f6b844767be4f2e02ad5246fa1f3", "ja": "それで、何かコンセプトがあるなら知りたいと\n思ったんです。MCの話題にもなりそうですし。", "zh": "所以我就好奇服装本身有没有什么设计的概念，\n感觉也能拿来当主持的话题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0124_1009_017kth", "source_sha256": "aaad5ace7747050658839aabd1cafb395879d4b5551b188e2dd06314d20c8093", "ja": "ファンのみなさんも、こういう話は\n聞きたいんじゃないかなって。", "zh": "说不定粉丝们，\n也会想听这类的话题呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0124_1010_p", "source_sha256": "8a763b352d4a04ffcf73cb43c49dd4bc19e5c2cbeec1f80c37750ec5d55f4ff6", "ja": "そうか。コンセプトというほど、\n大げさなものじゃないけど……", "zh": "这样啊。虽然这算不上是\n设计概念这么严肃的话题……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0124_1011_p", "source_sha256": "fecee1d73d529c45e4b260f6544b7976fa3877c9256cd4b79828487e5c802086", "ja": "青羽さんにお願いした時は、\n三者三様に輝くようにって話をしたよ。", "zh": "但我在拜托青羽小姐设计衣服时，\n有跟她说希望能让你们三人各自展现出不同的特色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0124_1012_017kth", "source_sha256": "4e932f021b8bb12cdf60cf4d8d4ca5acce9951ff963442ea4d5d5ea80858bc7f", "ja": "三者三様に輝くように……ですか？", "zh": "各自展现出不同的特色……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
